[F1] Semistandard structure ([[def-type-a-q-schur-algebra-and-weyl-modules]]): $S$ is finite dimensional over $F$; the $L^{\lambda}$, $\lambda\in\Lambda^{+}(d,n)$, form a complete set of pairwise non-isomorphic absolutely irreducible $S$-modules; the weight projections $p_
